    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How the cost index is calculated",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Relative cost index** = (routed answers + judge) \u00f7 (the same answer tokens on the capable tier) \u00d7 100, at published list prices (USD per 1M tokens, retrieved **2026-11-08**). Shown only as an index.\n\n| Model | Input | Output | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Groq gpt-oss-20b (fast, judge) | 0.075 | 0.30 | Groq production models table (console.groq.com/docs/models) |\n| Groq gpt-oss-120b (balanced) | 0.15 | 0.60 | Groq production models table |\n| NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra (capable) | 0.60 | 2.40 | OpenRouter list price via pricepertoken.com (updated 2026-11-07); NVIDIA's hosted dev endpoint has no list price |\n| NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt (backup judge) | 0.075 | 0.30 | No published price found; priced as gpt-oss-20b (proxy) |"
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
